{
  "_comment": "Combined view of all policy rules across nodes. Not loaded by ION - documentation only.",
  "_rfc_note": "Per RFC 9172, a single security source MUST NOT apply separate BIB and BCB to the same target block. BIB targets the primary block (tgt 0), BCB targets the payload block (tgt 1).",
